"""Closing sections for Islamabad pages that fell short of the word floor."""

PAGES = {}


def more(slug, text):
    PAGES[f"blogs/tax-consultant-{slug}.html"] = {"body_more": text}


more("e-8-islamabad", "## Getting Started\n\nServing officers usually need only the annual salary certificate, bank tax certificates and allotment papers. Retired officers add their pension statement and savings certificates, and families add records of gifts between members. We prepare each return and wealth statement remotely and explain them before filing, so that every family member's figures agree.")
more("f-5-islamabad", "## Getting Started\n\nSoftware houses should share bank realisation records for export receipts, PSEB certificates, payroll data and the previous year's accounts. Startups add their SECP documents and any investment agreements. Individual professionals need their salary certificates and bank statements. We work through each item and file once you approve the drafts.")
more("f7-islamabad", "## Getting Started\n\nBusinesses in Jinnah Super should share card machine statements, POS reports where applicable, purchase records and ICT services tax returns. Landlords need tenancy agreements and tenants' tax certificates. With these we prepare returns and, where needed, monthly services tax filings.")
more("f8-islamabad", "## Getting Started\n\nLawyers should keep a fee register for the year, listing each client, the fee and any tax deducted, together with the deduction certificates. Associates need records of payments from chambers. Consultants should bring their invoices and client certificates. We prepare the return from these and, where services are taxable, the ICT services returns.\n\nKeep copies of court fee receipts and chamber rent too; they support the expenses claimed against professional income.")
more("f-9-islamabad", "## Getting Started\n\nGyms and academies should share membership records, rent agreements, equipment invoices and staff salaries. Event organisers need contracts with sponsors and clients and records of payments to vendors. Trainers need a list of sessions and payments. We use these to prepare returns and any services tax filings.\n\nMembership fees received in advance should be recorded when received, with the period they cover noted.")
more("f10-islamabad", "## Getting Started\n\nShopkeepers and restaurant owners should share card machine statements, purchase invoices and monthly sales summaries. Owners of flats above the markaz need tenancy agreements and rent records. We combine these into a return and wealth statement and file after you approve.\n\nIf the building is jointly owned, tell us each owner's share so all returns agree.")
more("f11-islamabad", "## Getting Started\n\nFreelancers should share platform earnings reports, bank certificates and foreign wallet statements for 30 June. Markaz businesses need purchase and sales records; landlords their tenancy agreements. We prepare the return and wealth statement remotely and explain every figure before submission.\n\nIf you plan to buy a house soon, file first so your name is on the Active Taxpayers List.")
